# UI — Linear dark

SoT: [docs/current/ui-guidelines.md](../../docs/current/ui-guidelines.md).

- Dark only: `--surface-base` `#080A0A`. No light theme.
- Font: **Inter** (via `index.html`). Body ~17px.
- Accent / focus: `#5E6AD2`. Not orange for chrome.
- Scope chips stay `--scope-working` / `--scope-slot` / `--scope-system`.
- Radius 6px / 8px; 1px borders; 4px spacing scale (`--space-*`).
- Focus: 2px outline + 2px offset. Disabled: opacity 0.5.
- `100dvh`, not `100vh`. No new animation unless asked.
- Prefer CSS tokens over new hex. Update `ui-guidelines.md` if you add a token.
